source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-23
observed: `.` is not escapable: Jira shows the backslash, so a plain-text escaper may not write `\.`.
-- input.jira --
a\.b
-- rendered.html --
<p>a\.b</p>
-- want.md --
a\\.b
-- warnings.json --
[]
